	"Description": "An Okta policy was modified. Review the change: relaxing an MFA requirement or widening a network zone exclusion has the same effect as deleting the policy but looks like routine administration.\n\nEvent type: policy.lifecycle.update\n\nReference(s):\n- https://detection.fyi/elastic/detection-rules/integrations/okta/defense_evasion_okta_attempt_to_modify_okta_policy/\n\nThis scheduled search is a dispatcher on \"Alert - Okta - Alert Router\". Its name is what appears as the alert name, so rename it here if you want the alerts named differently.\n\nIt ships disabled; enable it once you have reviewed the query and are happy with the volume it produces.",
